And I'll tell you what is the main, basic thought of Judaism.

00:56:38.588 --> 00:56:41.788
First of all, let's see a little bit about the Qohim.

00:56:41.788 --> 00:56:47.788
The Qohim, they believe, philosophers and scientists, they believe that there is a universe. It's true.

00:56:47.788 --> 00:56:53.188
