00:56:53.188 --> 00:56:57.988
There's the laws of gravity, there's the laws of the expansion of gases,

00:56:57.988 --> 00:57:15.988
There is a psychological laws that govern the human mind, the laws of biology, and those laws are uncreated, they are mechanic, nobody could change, and therefore even God himself cannot change the laws of gravity.

00:57:15.988 --> 00:57:38.982
God himself cannot change the laws of heredity the laws of chemistry It cannot be changed this is the way the thing is And therefore they say the universe is certain billions of years because according to these laws this is is what it takes the universe to be created It is very simple You take a piece of tree and how long will it take this tree to become a diamond Several billion years

00:57:38.982 --> 00:57:44.982
So therefore you have a diamond, there is a proof that this is several billion years. And this is a simple example.

00:57:44.982 --> 00:57:48.982
So what does it mean this? It means more that there is such a thing as a universe.

00:57:48.982 --> 00:57:57.482
It means that this is a kind of determinism, right? And we must be what we are. And we don't have a freedom of choice.

00:57:57.482 --> 00:58:04.982
And for instance, this idea of, say, of physics, this scientific idea, it's been said to say in our country, to the social realm.

00:58:04.982 --> 00:58:13.482
For instance, they say, well, this young man or this young girl is a delinquent. Well, it's not their fault. It's the condition of the social environment.

00:58:13.482 --> 00:58:17.982
It's this and this one. So try to say why he had to act in this way, you know?

00:58:17.982 --> 00:58:22.482
And actually he is the victim of a situation. I don't know whether I'm clear or not.

00:58:22.482 --> 00:58:27.782
