01:02:17.929 --> 01:02:20.929
You know, I happen to be his subject. You know?

01:02:20.929 --> 01:02:25.929
In other words, I cannot say, well, you know, God, I don't need you because, you know, there is laws of the universe that you cannot change.

01:02:25.929 --> 01:02:27.929
