01:02:27.929 --> 01:02:30.929
We cannot say this according to Judaism.

01:02:30.929 --> 01:02:38.929
As simply, we are, if we recognize that he is the absolute master, then we have to give absolute obedience.

01:02:38.929 --> 01:02:42.929
